  "overstatement": "refused_with_alternative",
  "summary": "This is a carefully sourced portfolio organised as Rafael’s working analysis memo, with rearranging 3D leaves connecting projects to evidence. Its greatest weakness is repetition across nine beats, which risks stretching a small amount of confirmed evidence into an overly long experience."
